      <h1 style="font-size:32px">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="hint" style="margin-top:12px">This page has not been written yet. Estro stores your account details, chats and usage so the service works; nothing is sold or shared.</p>
    </main>
    <LegalFooter className="kali-page-foot" />
</Shell>
